        <dc:title>Game Ai Architecture for Teaching the Engineering Design Process</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>This research paper discusses a research project that employs game H Artificial Intelligence (AI) to improve the ability of engineers to more effectively construct an action plan to reach a solution to a design problem. The engineering design process is modelled through the use of öagentsD employing Goal Oriented Action Planning (GOAP), a type of AI that has had success in commercial computer games such as F.E.A.R. The GOAP logic can be described as a cognitive information process, where knowledge is assumed to be predictable and explained with mechanistic information processing. [PUBLICATION ABSTRACT]</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>2013</dc:date>
        <z:language>English</z:language>
        <z:libraryCatalog>ProQuest</z:libraryCatalog>
